<title>USA: Guardian International Q1 net loss rises.</title>
<headline>Guardian International Q1 net loss rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.03		    $0.00</p>
<p> Net loss		     202			  1</p>
<p> Total revs		 1,222			666</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,454		    3,227</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Guardian International Inc.</p>
<p>During the third quarter of fiscal 1996 Everest Security Systems Corporation (&quot;Everest&quot;) merged with Guardian International Inc, which at the time was a privately held Florida based company, in a reverse merger transaction. The name of the Company was then changed to Guardian International Inc. All amounts shown for the first quarter of fiscal 1996 are of the pre-merged Guardian International Inc.</p>
